      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should be renamed since it\u0027s not getting a \"token reference\". It\u0027s always returned a token object (e.g. KeystoneToken) but we considered it a reference since that object was of a dictionary type and we used reflection to build the object using a token reference, so it behaved like a pythonic object (as opposed to a data structure).\n\nNow that we\u0027re being explicit about the fact we\u0027re dealing with a python token model, we should make the name of the method reflect that.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 164,
        "startChar": 4,
